{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46802","headline":"闻沈彬赴吴都请辟 · 齐己","name":"闻沈彬赴吴都请辟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长讶高眠得稳无，果随徵辟起江湖。\n鸳鸯已列罇罍贵，鸥鹤休怀钓渚孤。\n白日不妨扶汉祚，清才何让赋吴都。\n可能更忆相寻夜，雪满诸峯火一炉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}